# Spec editing

- `05` is SSOT for `DisplayConfig`. Other docs reference; do not fork schema.
- Behavior change → update `06` AC and `13` TCs and bump file Version.
- Delivery/order change → update `15`.
- Test tooling change → update `11`/`14` + ADR-007 in `08`.
- Keep MUST/SHOULD/MAY vocabulary consistent with README.
- Prefer Vietnamese product copy; keep technical ids in English (`effectId`, AC-xx).
